-> ending_shell

=== ending_shell ===
The egg from the beginning reappears, cracking gently.
A soft, warm light spills through the fissures.
You: I met the self who lived today.
You: A light I haven't seen before.
-> END

=== ending_cards ===
Shards of the day that passed settle softly in mind.
You: I'll hold onto this day.
-> END

=== ending_walk ===
Demi trots ahead a few paces, then looks back at you.
Behind you lingers the gentle warmth of Dori Village.
You: Alright, let's go.
-> END
